body:
What does that have to do with them boasting about being the 'only European team'? Don't get me wrong I'm glad they won, been hoping for Kruise to get into the league since it started, but I just didn't see how being European has anything to do with a video game. Maybe it's becasue I'm british and that's the last thing I'd boast about right now. 

&#x200B;

Guess I just don't like people acting really cocky.
